        "prompt": "Create one controllable character sprite based on the friendly orange cat in the supplied reference artwork. Preserve that cat's exact identity, recognizable proportions, orange tabby colours and markings, cream muzzle/chest/paws, pink inner ears and nose, eyes, whiskers, curled striped tail, and all visible accessories exactly; do not substitute a different cat. Render soft sculpted 3D Clay forms with rounded edges, subtle handmade texture, gentle studio lighting, and a clean transparent sticker silhouette. Keep the cat front-facing overall and keep the face stable and clearly visible in every body clip. The cat's body may perform the named actions, but the face region remains one stable contiguous oval containing all facial features. No text, scenery, props, or extra characters.",
